      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "RUU Ordinan Peguam Bela (Sabah) (Pindaan) 2021"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_10",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 15 Ordinan dipinda dalam subseksyen (1) dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “he has” perkataan “a valid Annual Certificate and”. Pindaan seksyen 16b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_11",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "11",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_11__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_11__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_11__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 16b Ordinan dipinda dalam subseksyen (1)—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_11__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memotong perkataan “or” di hujung perenggan (c);"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_11__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan koma di hujung perenggan (d) dengan perkataan “; or”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_11__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_11",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan (d) perenggan yang berikut: “(e) is incapacitated due to illness or any other cause,”. Permulaan kuat kuasa seksyen 23 Akta A1528"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_12",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "12",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Walau apa pun subseksyen 1(2) Akta Ordinan Peguam Bela (Sabah) (Pindaan) 2017 [Akta A1528], Menteri boleh menetapkan tarikh yang berlainan bagi permulaan kuat kuasa seksyen 23 Akta Ordinan Peguam Bela (Sabah) (Pindaan) 2017 di Negeri Sabah dan Wilayah Persekutuan Labuan."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ini bolehlah dinamakan Akta Ordinan Peguam Bela (Sabah) (Pindaan) 2021."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ini mula berkuat kuasa pada tarikh yang ditetapkan oleh Menteri melalui pemberitahuan dalam Warta dan Menteri boleh menetapkan tarikh yang berlainan bagi permulaan kuat kuasa peruntukan yang berlainan Akta ini. Pindaan seksyen 7c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Ordinan Peguam Bela [Sabah Bab 2], yang disebut “Ordinan” dalam Akta ini, dipinda dalam subseksyen 7c(1) dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “preceding year” perkataan “or, in the case of admission of a person as an advocate, after such admission”. Pindaan seksyen 12a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_3__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_3__para_c",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_3__para_d",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_3__para_e"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 12a Ordinan dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (5), dengan memotong perkataan “with a member each from paragraphs 2(a), (b) and (c)”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (6), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “the Law Society” perkataan “or his alternate”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_3__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (7), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “the Law Society” perkataan “or his alternate”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_3__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (9), dengan menggantikan perkataan “a full-time employee” dengan perkataan “an employee”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_3__para_e",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "e",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (9) subseksyen yang berikut: “(9a) Wherever it is deemed necessary and expedient, the Disciplinary Board may sit in two or more panels consisting of members who shall be appointed by the Chairman from amongst the members of the Disciplinary Board. (9b) The quorum of the panel shall be three members. (9c) Any hearing, disposal, determination, decision, ruling, direction, order or final order of the panel shall be deemed to be the hearing, disposal, determination, decision, ruling, direction, order or final order of the Disciplinary Board.”. Pindaan seksyen 12c"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 12c Ordinan dipinda dalam subseksyen (1) dengan menggantikan perkataan “such rules as may from time to time be made under this Ordinance” dengan perkataan “section 12d”. Pindaan seksyen 12d"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_5__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_5__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 12d Ordinan dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_5__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan nota birai dengan nota birai yang berikut: “Classification and handling of complaints.”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_5__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (1) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: “(1) Where a written complaint is made or referred to the Disciplinary Board, the Disciplinary Board shall, if it is satisfied that— (a) there is no merit in the complaint or the complaint is frivolous and vexatious, dismiss the complaint and notify the complainant and the advocate concerned of its decision; or (b) there is merit in the complaint, proceed to hear such complaint in accordance with such rules as may from time to time be made under this Ordinance.”. Pindaan seksyen 12g"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_6",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_6__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_6__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 12g Ordinan dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_6__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subperenggan (1)(c)(i), dengan menggantikan perkataan “reprimand or censure” dengan perkataan “having costs awarded against him”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_6__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (2) subseksyen yang berikut: “(3) The Disciplinary Board may, at any stage of the disciplinary proceedings or in its decision in appropriate cases, make an order of costs against the complainant or against the advocate concerned, as the case may be, to be paid to the opposite party as the Disciplinary Board may deem fit.”. Pindaan seksyen 12h"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 12h Ordinan dipinda dalam subseksyen (5) dengan menggantikan perkataan “motion” dengan perkataan “summons”. Pindaan seksyen 13d"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_8__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_8__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_8__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 13d Ordinan dipinda—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_8__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (2)(g), dengan menggantikan perkataan “six” dengan perkataan “eight”;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_8__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (7), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “shall be elected” perkataan “biennially”; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_8__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_8",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan memasukkan selepas subseksyen (7) subseksyen yang berikut: “(7a) Election of members of the Executive Committee may be by show of hands or by secret ballot if the members at the meeting so decide, provided that the Law Society may make rules to provide for and to regulate voting by online voting or postal ballot in such cases as it may deem fit. (7b) Any rules made under subsection (7a) shall not come into operation until they have been published in the Sabah Government Gazette.”. Pindaan seksyen 13k"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@/~cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/8/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 13k Ordinan dipinda dalam perenggan (1)(c) dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “Executive Committee” perkataan “biennially”. Pindaan seksyen 15"
      }
    }
  ]
}
